  "rationale": "Neutral carry, not a candidate: flex_methanol.wsp5 carry-d3 (the numbers of flex_methanol.wsp2 D3) (sha256:2181b643430a31aefa8e774e9b9523f6f09b343957f1bdcae04ea435512545be) on droplet8.rs, the law of droplet6.rs for eight fuels. Its statements and those of its lineage in configs/models/flex/wsp5/methanol copied without change by the engineer (claude-opus-5-5); no number was changed or added. Inside the domain of droplet6.rs, at forecast times before 45 s, it gives the forecasts of that release and stands in for it in paired comparisons with candidates of spec flex_methanol-wsp-v8.",
